'''Cane''' is a [[rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Lumber Yard during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It's blade is white with red thick and thin stripes on it, resembling the appearance of a candy cane, hence the name. The guard is vanilla white, and the handle is solid black with a little red ribbon on it.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Cane Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Cane_Set_(2018) Cane Set (2018)].
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 18, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2659489985/Candy-canne-knife1 here].
*There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Sweater Knife (2018)]]’s decal would appear. However, this has since been patched.

